# Code owners for Dsinha97/fpl-app.
#
# Added 2026-09-03 as step 1 of the public-repo hardening runbook
# (docs/sprints/sprint-31.md, "Branch-protection runbook").
#
# On its own this file changes nothing: ownership is only enforced once
# "Require review from Code Owners" is enabled on the `main` ruleset, and that
# rule is deliberately NOT enabled yet. GitHub does not let a pull request
# author approve their own pull request, so on a one-person repo a Code-Owner
# review requirement paired with the runbook's no-administrator-bypass rule
# would block every merge, including the owner's. Enable it when a second
# maintainer exists — that is the trigger, not a date.
#
# What it does do today: make ownership explicit, and auto-request review from
# the owner on any pull request, including one opened from an outside
# contributor's fork.

